  unitName: Lonely Blade Iaroslava (EU)
  unitId: 750277
  unitNumber: 7234
  description: Iaroslava is a young girl with lots of hang-ups. She has an older
    sister who is already a famous huntress despite having graduated recently. She
    quickly fit in to the elite squad and was appointed valedictorian. Iaroslava
    admired her older sister and decided to join the Academy. However, her performance
    in the preliminary tests was mediocre. When asked if she was related to the famous
    huntress, she chose to hide the truth, too afraid of any comparison. She swore
    to herself that she would do everything in her power to be able to compete with
    her sister one day. With such will, what would she have to fear in the future?
  summonDesc: One day, I'll be greater than you... You will be proud of me!
  fusionDesc: I don't need to be friends with my squad...
